{"body": "There are four different Medicare Savings Programs to help people pay their Medicare costs. If you have Medicare Part A (hospital insurance benefits) you may qualify for one of these programs. Which program you qualify for depends on your income. There are no asset limits for these programs in Oregon.\n\nWho is eligible Programs How to apply Medicare help\n\nEnglish\n\nEspa\u00f1ol (Spanish)\n\n\u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587 (Chinese Simplified)\n\n\u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587 (Chinese Traditional)\n\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 (Korean)\n\nRom\u00e2n\u0103 (Romanian)\n\n\u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439 (Russian)\n\nAf Soomaali (Somali)\n\nTi\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t (Vietnamese)\n\nMedicare is a national health insurance program for people who are age 65 and older or meet other requirements.", "citation_label": "ODHS Aging and Disability Services: Help Paying Medicare Costs (Medicare Savings Programs), 2026 income limits 1", "citation_path": "us-or/guidance/odhs/medicare-savings-programs/2026/block-1", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2026-03-01", "heading": "Medicare Savings Programs", "id": "40481573-a090-5be8-bab8-b4c8842156c7", "jurisdiction": "us-or", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 10, "closure_elements": ["MED-ST-7"], "closure_elements_extra": ["MED-ST-1", "MED-ST-2", "MED-ST-3"], "content_type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review; needs-closure-2026-09-11 MED-ST-7", "document_subtype": "agency_program_page", "download_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "index_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "kind": "block", "pointer": "OAR 461-155-0290, -0291, -0295 in us-or/regulation/2026-09-10-tanf-state-policy-manual-chapter-461", "primary_source": true, "program": "MEDICARE_SAVINGS_PROGRAMS", "source_authority": "Oregon Department of Human Services, Aging and 