{"body": "Helps pay for: Medicare Part A and Part B premiums, deductibles and co-insurance.\n\nMonthly income limit*: $1,330 for an individual and $1,804 for a couple (100% of the federal poverty level).", "citation_label": "ODHS Aging and Disability Services: Help Paying Medicare Costs (Medicare Savings Programs), 2026 income limits 4", "citation_path": "us-or/guidance/odhs/medicare-savings-programs/2026/block-4", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2026-03-01", "heading": "Qualified Medicare Beneficiary (QMB) Program", "id": "af5fc719-06fa-5b0b-aed7-78b7d91421f2", "jurisdiction": "us-or", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 10, "closure_elements": ["MED-ST-7"], "closure_elements_extra": ["MED-ST-1", "MED-ST-2", "MED-ST-3"], "content_type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review; needs-closure-2026-09-11 MED-ST-7", "document_subtype": "agency_program_page", "download_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "index_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "kind": "block", "pointer": "OAR 461-155-0290, -0291, -0295 in us-or/regulation/2026-09-10-tanf-state-policy-manual-chapter-461", "primary_source": true, "program": "MEDICARE_SAVINGS_PROGRAMS", "source_authority": "Oregon Department of Human Services, Aging and People with Disabilities", "source_discovery_group": "us-or/guidance", "source_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "title": "ODHS Aging and Disability Services: Help Paying Medicare Costs (Medicare Savings Programs), 2026 income limits"}, "ordinal": 4, "parent_citation_path": "us-or/guidance/odhs/medicare-savings-programs/2026", "parent_id": "df43d025-f88a-527d-ad24-1824203be6b8", "source_as_of": "2026-09-14", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "us-or-odhs-medicare-savings-programs-2026", "source_path":