{"body": "Helps pay for: Medicare Part A premiums only.\n\nMonthly income limit*: $2,660 for a single person and $3,607 for a couple (200% of the federal poverty level).\n\nNote: This program is for disabled workers who lost Social Security disability benefits because they are working and are not eligible for another Medicaid program. Most people in Oregon are not eligible for QDWI because we have the Employed Persons with Disabilities (EPD) program . EPD provides full Medicaid benefits.", "citation_label": "ODHS Aging and Disability Services: Help Paying Medicare Costs (Medicare Savings Programs), 2026 income limits 5", "citation_path": "us-or/guidance/odhs/medicare-savings-programs/2026/block-5", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2026-03-01", "heading": "Qualified Disabled Working Individual (QDWI) Program", "id": "e7040bac-944f-5dee-8d93-4e178b673e65", "jurisdiction": "us-or", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 10, "closure_elements": ["MED-ST-7"], "closure_elements_extra": ["MED-ST-1", "MED-ST-2", "MED-ST-3"], "content_type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review; needs-closure-2026-09-11 MED-ST-7", "document_subtype": "agency_program_page", "download_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "index_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "kind": "block", "pointer": "OAR 461-155-0290, -0291, -0295 in us-or/regulation/2026-09-10-tanf-state-policy-manual-chapter-461", "primary_source": true, "program": "MEDICARE_SAVINGS_PROGRAMS", "source_authority": "Oregon Department of Human Services, Aging and People with Disabilities", "source_discovery_group": "us-or/guidance", "source_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "title": "ODHS Aging and Disability Services: Help Paying Medicare Costs (Medicare Savings Programs), 2026 income limits"}, "ordinal": 5, "parent_citation_path": "us-or/guidance/odhs/medicare-savings-programs/2026", "parent_id": "df43d025-f88a-527d-ad24-1824203be6b8", "source_as_of": "2026-09-14", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "us-or-odhs-medicare-savings-programs-2026", "source_path": "sources/us-or/guidance/2026-09-14-msp-income-standards/official-documents/us-or-odhs-medicare-savings-programs-2026.html", "source_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "version": "2026-09-14-msp-income-standards"}
