{"body": "Helps pay for: Medicare Part B premiums.\n\nMonthly income limit*: $1,796 for an individual and $2,435 for a couple (the federal government mandates services for people with incomes between 120% and 135% of the poverty level).\n\nWe are only allowed to serve a certain number of people each year for the SMF benefit. Unfortunately, we must shut down enrollment if we reach our limit. If you are eligible for any other Medicaid benefit offered by the State of Oregon, you are not eligible for the SMF benefit.\n\nNote: In most states, this program is called the Qualifying Individual (QI) program. In Oregon, this is called the SMF benefit.", "citation_label": "ODHS Aging and Disability Services: Help Paying Medicare Costs (Medicare Savings Programs), 2026 income limits 7", "citation_path": "us-or/guidance/odhs/medicare-savings-programs/2026/block-7", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2026-03-01", "heading": "Qualifying Individual (QI) Program (also called SMF benefit)", "id": "1f1b7b23-9110-52e2-96fd-ed26a68ea46e", "jurisdiction": "us-or", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 10, "closure_elements": ["MED-ST-7"], "closure_elements_extra": ["MED-ST-1", "MED-ST-2", "MED-ST-3"], "content_type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review; needs-closure-2026-09-11 MED-ST-7", "document_subtype": "agency_program_page", "download_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "index_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "kind": "block", "pointer": "OAR 461-155-0290, -0291, -0295 in us-or/regulation/2026-09-10-tanf-state-policy-manual-chapter-461", "primary_source": true, "program": "MEDICARE_SAVINGS_PROGRAMS", "source_authority": "Oregon Department of Human Services, Aging and People with Disabilities", "source_discovery_group": "us-or/guidance", "source_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "title": "ODHS Aging and Disability Services: Help Paying Medicare Costs (Medicare Savings Programs), 2026 income limits"}, "ordinal": 7, "parent_citation_path": "us-or/guidance/odhs/medicare-savings-programs/2026", "parent_id": "df43d025-f88a-527d-ad24-1824203be6b8", "source_as_of": "2026-09-14", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "us-or-odhs-medicare-savings-programs-2026", "source_path": "sources/us-or/guidance/2026-09-14-msp-income-standards/official-documents/us-or-odhs-medicare-savings-programs-2026.html", "source_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "version": "2026-09-14-msp-income-standards"}
{"body": "There are several ways to apply for Medicare Savings Programs.\n\nContact your local ODHS office\n\nCall the Aging and Disability Resource Connection ( ADRC ) at 855-673-2372\n\nApply online at one.oregon.gov\n\nIf you would like an application mailed to you, call the ONE Customer Service Center at 800-699-9075", "citation_label": "ODHS Aging and Disability Services: Help Paying Medicare Costs (Medicare Savings Programs), 2026 income limits 8", "citation_path": "us-or/guidance/odhs/medicare-savings-programs/2026/block-8", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2026-03-01", "heading": "How to apply", "id": "19f83db0-126d-525a-add7-8d55b867539e", "jurisdiction": "us-or", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"block_count": 10, "closure_elements": ["MED-ST-7"], "closure_elements_extra": ["MED-ST-1", "MED-ST-2", "MED-ST-3"], "content_type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review; needs-closure-2026-09-11 MED-ST-7", "document_subtype": "agency_program_page", "download_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "index_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "kind": "block", "pointer": "OAR 461-155-0290, -0291, -0295 in us-or/regulation/2026-09-10-tanf-state-policy-manual-chapter-461", "primary_source": true, "program": "MEDICARE_SAVINGS_PROGRAMS", "source_authority": "Oregon Department of Human Services, Aging and People with Disabilities", "source_discovery_group": "us-or/guidance", "source_url": "https://www.oregon.gov/odhs/aging-disability-services/pages/medicare-savings-programs.aspx", "title": "ODHS Aging and Disability Services: Help Paying Medicare Costs (Medicare Savings Programs), 2026 income limits"}, "ordinal": 8, "parent_citation_path": "us-or/guidance/odhs/medicare-savings-programs/2026", "parent_id": "df43d025-f88a-527d-ad24-1824203be6b8", "source_as_of": "2026-09-14", "source_fo